{"id":"n66563-2-4","stage":2,"title":"떼다 · 扣除","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66563-2-4-1","ko":"월급이 생각보다 너무 적어.","zh":"工资比想象中少太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"월급이","meaning":"月薪，月工资","explanation":"월급：月薪，月工资；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"월급","audio":"/audio/c384db10210a9b769d7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69619","senseId":"1","lemma":"월급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적어.","meaning":"少，小，欠缺","explanation":"적다：少，小，欠缺；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62051","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c384db10210a9b76","term":"월급","zh":"月薪，月工资","audio":"/audio/c384db10210a9b769d7c.mp3","entryId":"69619","definition":"每月作为工作的回报支付的报酬。","pronunciation":["월급"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"少，小，欠缺","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"62051","definition":"数、量或程度等达不到一定的标准。","pronunciation":["적ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/70577c0c42c3ac6c7efd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66563-2-4-2","ko":"여러 가지 세금을 월급에서 떼어 가잖아.","zh":"工资里还要扣除各种各样的税啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看